  {
   "id": "fatal-fury-city-of-the-wolves-260321@post-2025-07-12",
   "gameId": "fatal-fury-city-of-the-wolves-260321",
   "displayName": "Ken from Street Fighter brings the heat to FATAL FURY:CotW this summer!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2025-07-12T21:31:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/37f9a1280dcac5ee1109d0b3f0e5e9400f080be8.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "KEN: Character Trailer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "English VA",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://youtu.be/kKbFMdNeBzU\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Japanese VA",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://youtu.be/kBPbkPkTD2c\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fatal Fury x Street Fighter: The dream crossover!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ken and Chun-Li from Capcom's renowned fighting game franchise Street Fighter are coming to FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves! Their inclusion amounts to a legendary crossover like no other, as Fatal Fury's own Terry Bogard and Mai Shiranui are already on the Street Fighter 6 roster. Ken and Chun-Li join City of the Wolves as part of Season Pass 1, with Ken arriving in Summer 2025 and Chun-Li in Winter 2025.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Ken",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Voice Actors: Yuji Kishi (JA), David Matranga (EN)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A veteran Metro City street fighter who sets his sights on South Town, seeking closure for an incident to which he was wrongfully tied. Burning with determination and a fiery arsenal of unmatched offense, this former US National Fighting Champion eventually crosses paths with the Legendary Wolf himself—and with that, the wheels of fate are set in motion.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/0af122d83a7f8a432019104a88eb555cd3a55fa5.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/de388b00479f607a1a19293817475bb625484346.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Comes with classic red gi as an alternate costume!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players can choose to fight in Ken's iconic martial arts gi (as seen in Street Fighter 6 as Outfit 2) if they so desire.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/5f0c79b1bcb72834d48036c73fb1f05821bcab01.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New original stories for Ken in Arcade Mode and EOST!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Arcade Mode depicts the first meeting between Ken and Terry, serving as a prologue to their upcoming battles. In single-player RPG mode \"EOST,\" follow Ken as he unravels the plot of a shadowy figure who has begun to warp the people of South Town.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/3328586ab43bed2c66139a88c445ad0ce6c2eb9b.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "CotW Special Edition includes Street Fighter’s Ken and Chun-Li, plus the other DLC characters in Season Pass 1! Available now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* FATAL FURY: City of the Wolves will only be available in this Special Edition format.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "* There are no plans at this time to sell the base game and Season Pass 1 individually.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45050745/769e1c7100c73b28c0b0bbdbefe52fd1f07db212.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
